# Approved vulnerability exceptions for the dependency scan gate.
#
# Format (one ID per line):
#   <CVE|GHSA|PYSEC|MAL-...>  # reason | owner | review-by:YYYY-MM-DD
#
# Rules:
# - Every entry MUST include reason, responsible person, and a review date.
# - Prefer temporary exceptions; remove the line once the package is upgraded.
# - Changes to this file should be reviewed (see CODEOWNERS when configured).
#
# Example (do not leave real exceptions uncommented without approval):
# CVE-2020-1747  # not reachable: YAML loader unused | @alice | review-by:2026-12-01
